#GlobalNPCSInfo

BosshasAwoken: has awoken!
#BossSummonedInfo

BosshaveAwoken: have awoken!
RajahGlobalInfo1: Those who slaughter the innocent must be PUNISHED!
RajahGlobalInfo2: YOU HAVE COMMITTED AN UNFORGIVABLE SIN! I SHALL WIPE YOU FROM THIS MORTAL REALM! PREPARE FOR TRUE PAIN AND PUNISHMENT,
RajahGlobalInfo3: The eyes of a wrathful creature gaze upon you...
ChaosRuneYamataFalse: The imagery of a blazing demon flashes through your mind...
ChaosRuneAkumaFalse: The imagery of a 7 headed terror flashes through your mind...
ChaosRuneFalse: HAH! I WISH there were two of me to smash you into the ground!
ChaosRuneTrue1: Shen Doragon has been Awakened!
ChaosRuneTrue2: Skipping to the fun part, I see? I like you, child.
ChaosSigilFalse1: Only the blue half of the sigil is lit up...
ChaosSigilFalse2: Only the red half of the sigil is lit up...
ChaosSigilFalse3: HAH! I WISH there were two of me to smash you into the ground!
ChaosSigilFalse4: The Chaos Sigil glows, and imagery of the chaos pedestals flash through your mind
ChaosSigilFalse5: The Sigil does nothing.
ChaosSigilTrue1: Big mistake, child...
ChaosSigilTrue2: Hmpf...again..? Alright, let's just get this done and overwith.
ConfusingMushroomFalse1: The mushroom glows, and the smell of it makes you feel loopy.
ConfusingMushroomFalse2: The Feudal Fungus keeps trying to attack you
CuriousClawFalse1: The Grips of Chaos are already here!
CuriousClawFalse2: The claw lays limp in your hand. Nasty.
Grips.GripsofChaosAwoken: The Grips of Chaos have awoken!
DiamondCarrotRajahText1: GRAVE MISTAKE, TERRARIAN!
DiamondCarrotRajahText2: Show me what you got,
DjinnLampDesertFalse1: The lamp spits out sand as you rub it
DjinnLampDesertFalse2: No ammount of rubbing the lamp will save you here
DraconianDayTimeFalse: Geez, kid. Can't a dragon get a little shut-eye? Come back in the morning.
DraconianRuneFalse1: An image of the scorched tower at the peak of the inferno flashes through your mind
DraconianRuneFalse2: Hey kid, that rune only works once, ya know.
DraconianRuneInfernoFalse: You can only use that rune in the Inferno, kid.
DraconianRuneTrue1: The air around you begins to heat up...
DraconianRuneTrue2: Cutting right to the chase I see..? Alright then, prepare for hell..!
DraconianSigilFalse: Hey kid, that Sigil only works once, ya know.
DraconianSigilInfernoFalse: You can only use that Sigil in the Inferno, kid.
DraconianSignalTrue1: Heh, I hope you're ready to feel the fury of the blazing sun kid.
DraconianSignalTrue2: Back for more, kid? Don't you have better things to do? You already beat me once.  Alright, but I won't go easy on you.
DragonBellDayTimeFalse: The bell rings on deaf ears. The dragons are asleep now.
DragonBellFalse1: The Broodmother has already been called
DragonBellFalse2: The bell rings on deaf ears. The dragons are not here.
DreadRuneTrue1: Yamata has been Awakened!
DreadRuneTrue2: Yeah, yeah I get it, my first phase is obnoxious. Let's just get this over with..!
DreadTimeFalse: NO! I DON'T WANNA FIGHT NOW! I NEED MY BEAUTY SLEEP! COME BACK AT NIGHT!
DreadFalse1: An image of the strange tree at the heart of the mire flashes through your mind
DreadFalse2: WHAT THE HELL ARE YOU DOING?! I'M ALREADY HERE!!!
DreadMireFalse: Hey Dumbo! Mire is that way!
DreadSigilTrue1: You DARE enter my territory, Terrarian?! NYEHEHEHEHEH..! Big mistake..!
DreadSigilTrue2: Back for more..?! This time you won't be so lucky you little whelp..!
DreadSigilMireFalse: You NEED to use that sigil on the altar at the center of the mire! Trust me, nothing bad will happen!
EquinoxWormawoken: The Equinox Worms have awoken!
SistersDownedInfo1: Again..!? Didin't you learn from last time? Oh well, I'm gonna have a ball blasting you to shreds!
SistersDownedInfo2: Whatever, let's just get this over with.
SistersInfo1: Sigh... Here we go again...
SistersInfo2: THIS TIME I'M NOT LOSING! You're gonna feel the taste of defeat you disgusting warm-blood!
HydraChowTimeFalse: Nothing is coming. The creatures of the Mire sleep.
HydraChowFalse1: The Hydra wants that food.
HydraChowFalse2: Nothing is coming. Now you look dumb holding out this smelly ball of gunk.
InterestingClawFalse1: The Grips of Chaos are already here!
InterestingClawFalse2: The claw lays limp in your hand. Nasty.
IntimidatingMushroomFalse1: The mushroom just glares at you and gives you chills just looking at it.
IntimidatingMushroomFalse2: The mushroom Monarch keeps trying to stomp you
LifescannerFalse: The Lifescanner doesn't do anything.
ScepterBossFalse1: You wave the staff around like a psychopath. Nothing happens.
ScepterBossFalse2: Uh...what are you doing?
SubzeroCrystalSnowZoneFalse: The crystal shows an image of the nearby ice biome inside of it
SubzeroCrystalFalse: The Subzero Serpent continues to attack
ToadstoolFalse1: The toadstool croaks..?
ToadstoolFalse2: The Truffle Toad croaks
ZeroUnitFalse: ERR0R. ZER0 UNIT ALREADY ACTIVE. PLEASE TRY AGAIN LATER.
ZeroUnitVoidZoneFalse: ERR0R. PLAYER.GETM0DPLAYER<AAPLAYER>(M0D).Z0NEV0ID : :  FALSE. PLEASE TRY AGAIN LATER.
ZeroUnitRuneTrue: D00MSDAY PR0T0CALL ACTIVATED MANUALLY. TERMINATI0N SYSTEMS AT FULL P0WER
ZeroTesseractTrue: ZER0 UNIT ACTIVATED. ENGAGE D00MBRINGER PR0T0C0L.
ZeroTesseractDownedTrue: TARGET L0CKED. FAILURE T0 TERMINATE Y0U IS N0T A P0SSIBILITY THIS TIME, TERRARIAN.
RoyalRabbitSummoned1: Those who slaughter the innocent must be PUNISHED!
RoyalRabbitSummoned2: YOU WILL PAY FOR YOUR SINS,
ScrapHeapFalse1: You feel a static shock from using this. Maybe it's trying to send a signal?
ScrapHeapFalse2: Orthrus wants to eat that AND you!
CyberneticClawFalse1: The claw just lays limp in your hand.
CyberneticClawFalse2: The Retriever is still trying to grab you!
CyberneticBellFalse1: The bell rings, but nothing happens.
CyberneticBellFalse2: The Raider hears the bell and keeps attempting to kill you!
CyberneticShroomFalse1: Stop waving that metal mushroom around like a psychopath.
CyberneticShroomFalse2: The Techno Truffle continues to exist.
CursedCompassFalse: The curses bound to the compass wail at their maker's presence.
MassShroomInitiated: It's time for a Mush Pit!
GlowingMassShroomInitiated: You are being assaulted by a bunch of fungi!
GlowingMassShroomFalse: Stop waving a bunch of shrooms around in the middle of nowhere like a nutcase.

