	InAnyMire: In the Mire biome
	InAnyRedMushroom: In the Red Mushroom biome
	InAnyVoid: In the Void biome
	SpawnedBySubzeroSerpent: If Subzero Serpent is not currently alive
	PostLateAncientsAndRemovedWorldAndExpert: If the Equinox Worms have been defeated
